Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二部分要把训练脚本送出去：构建驾驶舱，打包代码，发一个任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Part 2 ships the trainer: build the cockpit, pack the code, send one job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.12,0:00:10.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把你的 bucket 和项目填进 docker-shell.sh 第 8、9 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Put your bucket and project on lines 8 and 9 of docker-shell.sh;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.00,0:00:11.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，改成你自己的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and edit yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.85,0:00:17.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：README 里贴的这份脚本，不是真正的文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the README's copy of this script is not the real file.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.56,0:00:21.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它有方括号里的注释，还有一行旧写法是给 Apple 芯片用的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It has notes in brackets and an older line for Apple chips,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.27,0:00:22.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以要改脚本文件本身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so edit the script itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.22,0:00:27.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它按 amd64 构建，并挂载你的代码和 secrets\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It builds for amd64 and mounts your code and secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.60,0:00:31.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在在 repo 里面跑 sh docker-shell.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now run sh docker-shell.sh from inside the repo;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.33,0:00:32.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.15,0:00:35.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天它在 14 步里的第 2 步就失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today it fails at step 2 of 14.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.79,0:00:40.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全部 22 个包都从 Debian 软件源返回 404 Not Found\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}All 22 packages return 404 Not Found from the Debian mirror,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.57,0:00:43.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,构建停在第 18 行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the build stops at line 18.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:45.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本里的 set -e，也就是出错就退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The script's set -e, exit on error,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.76,0:00:47.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,于是在 docker run 之前就把它停下了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then stops it before docker run.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:49.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.86,0:00:54.22,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每条报错都是 Debian 软件源返回的 404，而你的网络是通的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Every error says 404 from the Debian mirror, and your internet works.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.54,0:00:57.01,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Dockerfile 的哪一行决定了你的 Debian？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which line of the Dockerfile picks your Debian?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.85,0:01:07.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 2 行，FROM 那一行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 2, the FROM line.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.68,0:01:09.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代号 bullseye 就是 Debian 11\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Bullseye is Debian 11,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.35,0:01:16.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,录制时它的安全更新源列出的包已经不再提供，这些包搬到了归档源\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and at the time of recording its security mirror lists packages it no longer serves; they moved to an archive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.67,0:01:18.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一处修复，是额外步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first fix, an extra,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.30,0:01:20.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 base image 换成 bookworm\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}switches the base to bookworm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.07,0:01:22.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也就是 Debian 12；暂停一下，改好它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Debian 12; pause and make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.58,0:01:24.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，再跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.38,0:01:26.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这次它停在第 8 步\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now it stops at step 8:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.23,0:01:30.03,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,google-cloud-sdk 报 no installation candidate\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}google-cloud-sdk has no installation candidate,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.03,0:01:32.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,取而代之的是 google-cloud-cli\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and google-cloud-cli replaces it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.02,0:01:34.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Google 给它的 apt 包改了名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Google renamed its apt package.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.22,0:01:41.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二处修复，也是额外步骤：在第 37 行改装 google-cloud-cli\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second fix, also an extra: install google-cloud-cli instead, on line 37;
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.44,0:01:43.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，改好它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and make it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.26,0:01:46.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下 git diff，能看到你改过的全部内容\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra git diff shows everything you changed:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.27,0:01:49.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你填的两个值，两处修复，没有别的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your two values, the two fixes, and nothing else.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.65,0:01:54.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，跑第三遍：它构建成功了，这里大约 5 分钟\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and run it a third time: it builds, about 5 minutes here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:58.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Apple Silicon 上更久，因为 amd64 要模拟运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}longer on Apple Silicon, where amd64 is emulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:02:02.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,横幅显示它在运行，接着 gcloud 打不开密钥文件\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The banner says running, then gcloud cannot open the key file:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.10,0:02:03.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是我们缺的那把密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}our missing key.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.90,0:02:06.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换成你的密钥，这一行会确认服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With yours, this line confirms the service account.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.25,0:02:11.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本照样往下走，因为 entrypoint 里没有 set -e\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The script carries on anyway, because the entrypoint has no set -e.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.93,0:02:17.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,架构是 x86 64，在 Mac 上也一样；版本号都在画面上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The architecture is x86_64, on a Mac too; the versions are on screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.82,0:02:21.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：activated 是在激活之前打印的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: activated is printed before the activation,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.40,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只是一句话，不是事实\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a label, not a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.95,0:02:27.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在驾驶舱里做几个额外检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside the cockpit, a few extra checks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:30.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,/secrets 是空的，这是我们的沙盒\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}/secrets is empty, our sandbox.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.79,0:02:36.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,项目、bucket 和密钥都传进来了；gcloud、gsutil 和 uv 都在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Project, bucket and key came through; gcloud, gsutil and uv are here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.41,0:02:37.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，检查你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and check yours:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.99,0:02:42.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后那个数，对这个 wandb pin 应该是 40，绝不能是 0\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the last number should be 40 for this wandb pin, never 0;
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.10,0:02:45.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果不是，去看“谁提交，谁运行”那一章\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if not, see the chapter Who submits, who runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:47.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可是 import TensorFlow 失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}But importing TensorFlow fails:
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.90,0:02:51.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 container 只提交任务，从不训练\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}this container submits jobs, it never trains.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.80,0:02:56.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看 setup.py；暂停一下，打开它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Review setup.py; pause and open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.04,0:03:00.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它就是 pip 安装 tar 包时看的铭牌\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is the label pip uses to install the tarball.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.63,0:03:06.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,唯一声明的依赖是 wandb，pin 在 0.15.11\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The only declared dependency is wandb, pinned to 0.15.11.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.62,0:03:10.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的 find packages 调用能找到 trainer 目录\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its find_packages() call finds the trainer folder
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.15,0:03:14.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为这个目录有自己的 init 文件，所以装好之后\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because the folder has its own __init__.py, so once installed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.61,0:03:16.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,python -m trainer.task 就能跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}python -m trainer.task works.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.01,0:03:19.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,TensorFlow 和 scikit-learn 都没有声明\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}TensorFlow and scikit-learn are not declared:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:23.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,默认它们来自 Google 提供的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}they are assumed to come from the image Google provides,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:26.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,后面有一章会看到 tar 包里没有它们\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and a later chapter shows the tarball lacks them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.74,0:03:29.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 requests 只是因为 wandb 需要它才被带进来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Requests only arrives because wandb needs it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.98,0:03:33.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,接着看 task.py；暂停一下，打开它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Review task.py next; pause and open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.50,0:03:35.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在 notebook 里的选项都成了命令行参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The notebook choices are flags now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.67,0:03:39.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而密钥参数默认是文本 16：记住这一点\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the --wandb_key flag defaults to the text 16: remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.92,0:03:45.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,数据来自一个 GitHub release，因为任务看不到你的笔记本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The data comes from one GitHub release, since the job cannot see your laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.41,0:03:48.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 W&B 的登录在下载之后才运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and the W&B login runs after that download.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.72,0:03:53.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在打包：在 container 里跑 sh package-trainer.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now pack it: run sh package-trainer.sh inside the container;
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:54.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:58.09,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,命令 tar 列出了八个条目，而上传失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Tar lists eight entries, and the upload fails:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:00.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们的占位 bucket 并不存在\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}our placeholder bucket does not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.83,0:04:04.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 4 行用的是固定的文件名，所以每次上传都会覆盖上一次\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 4 uses a fixed name, so each upload overwrites the last.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.83,0:04:09.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查：这个 tar 包是 4016 字节\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Extra checks: the tarball is 4,016 bytes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.67,0:04:14.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在我们的 Linux 引擎上，它属于 root，因为是 container 写的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On our Linux engine it belongs to root, because the container wrote it;
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:15.82,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Docker Desktop 上，它属于你\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}on Docker Desktop, to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.14,0:04:17.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,不管哪种情况，Git 都会忽略它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Git ignores it either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.07,0:04:19.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.73,0:04:21.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你改了 task.py 里的一个错字\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You fix a typo in task.py.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.25,0:04:25.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你是重新构建 image，再跑一次打包脚本，还是两个都做？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Do you rebuild the image, run the package script again, or both?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.77,0:04:34.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只要重跑打包脚本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only the package script.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.62,0:04:37.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,Vertex AI 运行的是你 bucket 里的 tar 包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Vertex AI runs the tarball in your bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 image 从来不会被带过去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and your image never travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.76,0:04:43.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,驾驶舱挂载了你的代码目录，所以已经能看到这次修改\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The cockpit mounts your code folder, so it already sees the edit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.80,0:04:47.81,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,金色标签：tar 包存在你的 bucket 里，而且很小\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A gold tag: the tarball is stored in your bucket, and it is tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.45,0:04:52.74,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再看 cli.sh；暂停一下，打开它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Review cli.sh; pause and open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.06,0:04:55.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它用随机的十六进制串给任务命名\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It names the job with random hex,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.63,0:05:00.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,申请一台 n1-standard-4 机器，并设定一个 GPU image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}asks for one n1-standard-4 machine, and sets a GPU image.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.39,0:05:04.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后它指向 bucket 里你的 tar 包和要运行的模块\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it points at your tarball in the bucket and the module to run,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.75,0:05:08.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再拼出参数，最后是你的 W&B 密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and builds the arguments, ending with your W&B key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.32,0:05:11.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再往下，GPU 那一段被注释掉了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Further down, the GPU block is commented out
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.87,0:05:17.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 31 行换成 CPU image，所以只有 CPU 那条命令会运行\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and line 31 swaps in the CPU image, so only the CPU command runs.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.45,0:05:21.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：README 先讲 GPU\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: the README shows GPU first and CPU
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.38,0:05:25.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 CPU 写成可选，可这个脚本本来就在 CPU 上跑\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as optional, but the script already runs on CPU.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:29.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看金色标签：一旦任务的机器分配好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A gold tag first: once the job's machine is provisioned,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.45,0:05:32.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的项目就一直付费，直到脚本退出\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}your project pays until the script exits.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.61,0:05:34.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,确认你的密钥长度是 40\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Check that your key length is 40;
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.69,0:05:39.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果不是，先看下一章“谁提交，谁运行”，再提交\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}if not, watch the next chapter, Who submits, who runs, before you submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.63,0:05:43.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在跑 sh cli.sh；暂停一下，自己跑一遍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now sh cli.sh; pause and run it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.40,0:05:48.42,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一行是真的：us-central1 的 Vertex AI endpoint\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first line is real: the Vertex AI endpoint in us-central1.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.74,0:05:52.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后它停下了，没有激活的账号，因为密钥从来没加载过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then it stops with no active account, because the key
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.12,0:05:54.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下 gcloud auth list，就能确认\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}never loaded; an extra auth list confirms it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.31,0:05:58.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,换成你的密钥，gcloud 会报告任务已创建\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}With your key, gcloud reports the job as created.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:03.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外用 sh -x 跟踪一遍，能看到它想发出去的任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra trace with sh -x shows the job it tried to send.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:07.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,GPU image 先被设好，然后被 CPU image 覆盖\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The GPU image is set, then overridden by the CPU image.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.23,0:06:09.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是完整的命令\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the full command.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:13.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 worker pool spec 就是这个任务的机器订单\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The worker pool spec is the job's machine order:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.13,0:06:17.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,机器类型、一个副本，也就是一台机器，再加上 image 和模块\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}machine type, one replica, meaning one machine, image and module.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.79,0:06:22.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,最后是参数，结尾是明文的 W&B 密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Last come the arguments, ending with your W&B key in plain text.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.77,0:06:24.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.43,0:06:28.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的 W&B 密钥现在成了任务参数的一部分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your W&B key is now part of the job's arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.51,0:06:30.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以后谁能看到它？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Who can see it later?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.67,0:06:43.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个项目里能查看任务的任何人，因为任务规格会保存它的参数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Anyone who can view jobs in this project, because the job spec keeps its arguments,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:46.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要是你直接敲在命令里，还有你的 shell 历史\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}plus your shell history if typed inline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.88,0:06:50.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,用一把专用的密钥，结束时轮换掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Use a dedicated key and rotate it at the end;
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:52.64,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,练习里用的是 Secret Manager\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the exercises use Secret Manager.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:57.06,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,另一种出错的方式：在一个从没 export 过密钥的终端里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The other way it goes wrong: a terminal where the key was never exported.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.38,0:07:01.91,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,进去之后，它的长度是 0，参数的结尾是一个空的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Inside, its length is 0, and the arguments end with an empty key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.23,0:07:06.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以任务会先下载数据，然后才在登录时失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So the job would download its data, and only then fail at login.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.66,0:07:11.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,退出、export，再重新开始；先退出旧的驾驶舱，名字还被它占着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exit, export, and start again; first exit any old cockpit, which holds the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:15.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个任务都有三枚徽章参与\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three badges take part in every job.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.30,0:07:20.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一枚是你的密钥文件，属于 model-trainer 这个服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The first is your key file, for the model-trainer service account.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.37,0:07:24.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它的三个角色让它能写你的 bucket、创建任务：它负责提交\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Its three roles let it write to your bucket and create jobs: it submits.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.00,0:07:29.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第三枚是你的 W&B 密钥，进的完全是另一栋楼\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The third is your W&B key, for a different building altogether,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.30,0:07:32.23,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,靠手动放进任务的参数里带过去\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}carried by hand inside the job's arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.55,0:07:34.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,中间那根挂绳还空着\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The middle lanyard is still empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.93,0:07:36.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.60,0:07:40.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务从你的私有 bucket 安装你的包\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The job installs your package from your private bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.02,0:07:43.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,可你的密钥文件从没离开过你的笔记本。这是怎么做到的？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but your key file never left your laptop. How?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:56.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二枚徽章：你项目的 Vertex AI 服务代理\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The second badge: your project's Vertex AI service agent,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:58.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个由 Google 管理的服务账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a service account Google manages.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.25,0:08:04.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务默认以它的身份运行，它能打开同一个项目里的 bucket\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}By default the job runs as it, and it can open buckets in the same project.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:06.59,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你的密钥只证明了是谁提交的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Your key only proved who submitted.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.91,0:08:09.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果任务访问你的 bucket 时报 403\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If a job ever gets a 403 on your bucket,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.80,0:08:12.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,就要给这个身份授予访问权限\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}that is the identity to grant access.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:14.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 Vertex 上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}On Vertex,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.10,0:08:17.79,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务的第一步是把你的 tar 包安装进 Google 的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the job's first step installs your tarball into Google's image.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:19.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们这里跑不了 Vertex\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We can't run Vertex here,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.76,0:08:23.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以在笔记本上把这一步重跑一遍，标成替身\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}so we rerun that step on the laptop, tagged as a stand-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.89,0:08:27.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在一个普通的 Python 3.10 container 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}In a plain Python 3.10 container,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.07,0:08:32.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,pip 安装这个 tar 包：你的包，加上 wandb 0.15.11\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pip installs the tarball: your package, plus wandb 0.15.11.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.98,0:08:37.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下 pip list：有 wandb、requests 和它们的辅助依赖\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra pip list shows wandb, requests and their helpers,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.13,0:08:39.85,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,但没有 TensorFlow，也没有 scikit-learn\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}but no TensorFlow and no scikit-learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.17,0:08:43.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练脚本指望预构建的 image 提供这些\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The trainer counts on the prebuilt image for those,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.11,0:08:44.89,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而我们没有把它拉下来检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}which we did not pull to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.21,0:08:48.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有它，训练脚本连帮助信息都打不出来\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Without it, the trainer cannot even print its help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.80,0:08:55.35,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是训练脚本里 W&B 的第一步，第 153 行，用三个密钥试一试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then the trainer's first W&B step, line 153, with three keys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.67,0:09:00.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,上一章那个空的密钥，报 api key not configured\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The empty key from the last chapter fails with api_key not configured,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:05.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而在 Vertex 上，这发生在数据下载之后，用的是计费的机器时间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and on Vertex that comes after the data download, on billed machine time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,默认的 16 会失败，报\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The default of 16 fails:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.76,0:09:11.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,API key must be 40 characters long, yours was 2\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}API key must be 40 characters long, yours was 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.09,0:09:17.00,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们 40 个字符的占位密钥，能通过离线的长度检查，仅此而已\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Our 40 character placeholder passes the offline length check, and nothing more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.55,0:09:19.96,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一点：这个老的 wandb pin\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One more: this old wandb pin
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:23.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只接受正好 40 个字符，47 个就会失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}accepts exactly 40 characters, and 47 fails.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.08,0:09:27.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,我们没法确认 W&B 现在发的密钥是什么格式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}We could not check which key format W&B gives out today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:32.44,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你的不一样，这个 pin 会拒绝它，所以提交之前先检查\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If yours differs, this pin refuses it, so check before you submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.76,0:09:34.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个办法，这里没有测试过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One fix, untested here:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:39.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把 setup.py 里 wandb 的 pin 升到当前的版本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}raise the wandb pin in setup.py to a current release,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.26,0:09:43.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再跑一次 sh package-trainer.sh，然后提交\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}run sh package-trainer.sh again, and then submit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.31,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要查看任务，打开 Vertex AI\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To view jobs, open Vertex AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.31,0:09:49.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,再点 Training，再点 Custom jobs\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then Training, then Custom jobs;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.77,0:09:51.70,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，找找你的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}pause and look for yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.02,0:09:56.24,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它是一个自定义任务，不是训练 pipeline，所以要去那个标签页找\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It is a custom job, not a training pipeline, so look on that tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.56,0:09:59.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打开你的任务，点它的日志链接\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Open your job and follow its logs link;
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.13,0:10:01.77,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,等那行 Training Job Complete 出现\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}wait for the line Training Job Complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:03.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务会打印什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}What will the job print?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:07.34,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这期视频没有任何任务日志，所以这里给出的是它的样子\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}No job log exists for this video, so here is its shape,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按代码自己的 print 语句拼出来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}built from the code's own print lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:13.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这些数量是两个 notebook 用同样的代码打印出来的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The counts are the ones both notebooks printed for the same code.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.15,0:10:16.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,打印 label 的那一行没有固定的顺序\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The labels line has no fixed order,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.49,0:10:20.04,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两个 notebook 就能说明这一点，而且也没有保存 label 映射\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}as the two notebooks show, and no label map is saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.36,0:10:22.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这段 summary 最后多出来一个 None\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The summary ends with a stray None,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.46,0:10:25.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为代码打印的是 summary 的返回值\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because the code prints what summary returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.48,0:10:29.61,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,训练本身在这里是一段空白，没有 epoch、loss，也没有时间\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Training itself is a gap here, with no epochs, loss or times,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.61,0:10:32.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后是那行 Training Job Complete\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}then the line Training Job Complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.28,0:10:35.87,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要查看指标，README 让你去 W&B 的项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To view metrics, the README sends you to the W&B
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.87,0:10:38.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,cheese-training-vertex-ai\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}project cheese-training-vertex-ai.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.73,0:10:42.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它承诺训练指标会被自动追踪、自动更新\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It promises training metrics, tracked and updated automatically.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.99,0:10:45.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,说得客气点，用这份代码做不到\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To put it kindly, not with this code.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.53,0:10:49.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,按 task.py 的写法，以模型命名的那个 run 有 config\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From task.py, the run named after the model gets its config,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.80,0:10:55.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,包括执行时间，还有系统图表，而它的曲线位置一直是空的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}including the execution time, and system charts, and its curve slots stay empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.81,0:10:57.71,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,暂停一下，打开你的项目\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Pause and open your project.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.95,0:11:00.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题，用课上列的七样\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder, with the lecture's list of seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.30,0:11:03.69,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这个 run 实际存下了哪几样？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Which of them does this run actually keep?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.53,0:11:14.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,模型和它的设置，有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The model and its settings, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:21.15,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,环境只算一部分：有系统图表，而 image 的 tag 写在 cli.sh 里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The environment only partly: system charts, while the image tag sits in cli.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.47,0:11:25.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,指标，没有：执行时间进了 config\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Metrics, none: the execution time goes into the config.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.53,0:11:27.25,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,日志有，权重没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Logs yes, weights no.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.57,0:11:29.17,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,代码、数据和笔记，没有\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Code, data and notes, no:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.17,0:11:32.46,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有 commit，一个固定的 zip 包，还有一次没有随机种子的划分\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}no commit, a fixed zip, and an unseeded split.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.78,0:11:37.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,notebook A 的那个目录没有 commit，没有划分，也没有笔记\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The folder from notebook A has no commit, no split and no notes either.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.83,0:11:41.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,所以结论是：这些表选不出哪种做法更好\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}So the verdict: these tables cannot crown a recipe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.53,0:11:45.41,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,给划分加上随机种子，对齐 epoch，记下代码版本，然后再比较\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Seed the split, match the epochs, keep the code version, then compare.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.73,0:11:48.07,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,练习 1 会加一个小小的 callback\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exercise 1 adds a small callback.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.12,0:11:52.60,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,现在反过来看 README 那个可选的 CPU 步骤\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Now the reverse of the README's optional CPU step:
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.60,0:11:55.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要在 GPU 上训练，需要什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}what would it take to train on a GPU?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.50,0:11:57.20,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,三个开关必须一致\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Three switches must agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.52,0:12:01.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,加速器：worker pool spec 里的一块 T4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The accelerator: one T4 in the worker pool spec.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:04.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,image：为 GPU 构建的 TensorFlow\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The image: TensorFlow built for GPUs,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.27,0:12:06.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,带 CUDA，也就是 GPU 的库\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with CUDA, the GPU libraries.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.89,0:12:10.45,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有配额：这个区域里给自定义训练用的 T4\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And the quota: T4s for custom training in this region.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:13.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,芯片只在三个都打开时才会亮\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The chip lights only when all three are on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.08,0:12:17.50,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,配额就是准备工作那一章里在控制台提交的申请\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The quota is the console request from the setup chapter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:21.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外检查显示，Google 两个 GPU image 都还在提供\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}An extra check shows Google still serves both GPU images,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:23.47,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这是录制时的情况\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}at the time of recording.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:28.37,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,要切换，就取消 GPU 那一段的注释，再把 CPU 那一段注释掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}To switch, uncomment the GPU block and comment out the CPU block.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.69,0:12:32.48,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两段都留着，你就会提交两个同名的任务\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Leave both active, and you submit two jobs with the same name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.73,0:12:37.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，GPU 那一段会和我们提交 CPU 任务时一样失败\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here the GPU block would fail the same way as our CPU submit did,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.10,0:12:42.27,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为没有激活的账号，所以没有新东西可看，我们也不造假\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with no active account, so there is nothing new to show, and nothing we fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.52,0:12:48.30,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,金色标签：GPU 会增加费用，只要它挂着，不管用没用\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A gold tag: a GPU adds to the bill for as long as it is attached, used or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.53,0:12:50.13,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:52.76,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你在 CPU 那一段里加上加速器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You add the accelerator to the CPU block.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.08,0:12:57.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,任务跑起来了，日志里 GPU Available 后面是一个空列表\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The job runs, and its log says GPU Available: [], an empty list.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.07,0:12:59.67,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.63,0:13:09.39,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 31 行设的是 CPU image，里面没有 CUDA\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Line 31 sets a CPU image, which has no CUDA.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.71,0:13:12.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这块 T4 挂着、闲着，照样计费\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The T4 is attached, idle, and still billed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.95,0:13:15.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,练习 5 让你自己试一试\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Exercise 5 lets you try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.13,0:13:20.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,课上讲的最后一个想法是多 GPU 训练，有三种形态\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The last idea of the lecture is multi-GPU training, in three shapes:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.95,0:13:26.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一台机器一块 GPU，一台机器多块 GPU，以及多台机器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one machine with one GPU, one machine with several, and several machines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:29.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,今天讲中间那种形态，也就是 MirroredStrategy\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Today is the middle one, the mirrored strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.42,0:13:34.57,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,单 GPU 的训练脚本也会创建一个，但只是用来数 GPU\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The single-GPU trainer also creates one, but only to count GPUs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.80,0:13:36.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,思路是这样的\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here is the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.38,0:13:40.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每块 GPU 上都有一份一模一样的模型拷贝，叫作副本\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each GPU holds an identical copy of the model, called a replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.20,0:13:46.56,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,64 的全局 batch，也就是一步的量，被分成两半，每半 32\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A global batch of 64, one step's worth, splits into two halves of 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.88,0:13:49.73,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每块 GPU 在自己那一半上算梯度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Each GPU computes gradients on its half.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两份梯度通过一条叫 all-reduce 的连线取平均\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The two are averaged across a link called all-reduce,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.33,0:13:56.99,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两份拷贝走同样的一步，所以一直保持一致\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and both copies take the same step, so they stay identical.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.31,0:14:00.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在 strategy.scope 里创建的变量会被复制\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Variables created inside the scope are mirrored,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.78,0:14:02.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每块 GPU 一份同步的拷贝\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}one synced copy per GPU;
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:05.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在外面构建的模型不会被复制\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}a model built outside is not mirrored.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:11.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,先看 cli-multi-gpu.sh，按 README 的顺序；暂停一下，打开它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Review cli-multi-gpu.sh first, in README order; pause and open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.94,0:14:15.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它申请一台 n1-standard-32 机器\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It asks for one n1-standard-32 machine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.21,0:14:17.53,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,带两块 T4，训练 5 个 epoch\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}with two T4s, for 5 epochs.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.85,0:14:22.78,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有一个小疏漏：它的 TensorFlow image 比较老\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A small slip: its TensorFlow image is older,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.78,0:14:26.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,是 2.14，而 cli.sh 用的是 2.17\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}2.14, where cli.sh uses 2.17.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.27,0:14:30.02,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后看多 GPU 训练脚本；暂停一下，打开它\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then review the multi-GPU trainer; pause and open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.34,0:14:32.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,这就是课上讲的三处改动\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}These are the lecture's three changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.84,0:14:34.80,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它创建 MirroredStrategy\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It creates the mirrored strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.12,0:14:38.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,它把 batch 大小乘以副本数\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}It multiplies the batch size by the number of replicas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.87,0:14:43.08,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并且在 strategy.scope 里构建、编译模型\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And it builds and compiles the model inside the scope of the strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:45.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而 model.fit 没变\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}model.fit is unchanged.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.35,0:14:46.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,来想一个问题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Something to ponder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.01,0:14:52.97,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,两块 GPU，batch 大小参数是 32，一共 936 张训练图片\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two GPUs, --batch_size=32, and 936 training images.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.29,0:14:57.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个 epoch 有多少步，每块 GPU 每一步看到多少张图片？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}How many steps per epoch, and how many images does each GPU see per step?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.82,0:15:11.75,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,全局 batch 是 64，所以是 15 步，最后一步不满\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The global batch is 64, so 15 steps, the last one partial,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.75,0:15:15.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,每个完整的步里每块 GPU 拿 32 张\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and 32 images per GPU on each full step.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.48,0:15:16.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,有两点要注意\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two caveats.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:21.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学习率还是 0.001，而 batch 翻了一倍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The learning rate stays at 0.001 while the batch doubles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:24.26,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,而且两块 GPU 不会快一倍\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And two GPUs are not twice as fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:27.92,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为启动、拉取 image 和下载都不会变短\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because start-up, image pull and download don't shrink.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.15,0:15:34.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,你需要所在区域里自定义训练的配额：两块 T4 和 32 个虚拟 CPU\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}You need quota for two T4s and 32 virtual CPUs of custom training in your region.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.64,0:15:40.18,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,金色标签：这是这节课最大的机器，所以先看价目页\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A gold tag: this is the biggest machine of the lecture, so check the pricing page first.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.50,0:15:46.05,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,如果你的配额批下来了，暂停一下，跑 sh cli-multi-gpu.sh\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}If your quota came through, pause and run sh cli-multi-gpu.sh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:50.49,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在这里，它和 cli.sh 一样失败，没有激活的账号\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Here it fails like cli.sh, with no active account.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.53,0:15:55.62,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,还有一种 README 从没提过的启动方式\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One launcher the README never mentions is cli.py,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:57.38,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,cli.py，走 Python SDK 的路线\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}the Python SDK route.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.70,0:16:00.36,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,额外跑一下，它马上就失败了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}As an extra run, it fails at once,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.36,0:16:04.21,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,因为只有 cli.sh 设置了 region 变量\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}because only cli.sh sets the GCP_REGION variable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.53,0:16:07.32,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,把它 export 之后，它又卡在缺失的密钥文件上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Export it, and it fails at the missing key file.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.25,0:16:11.98,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,那训练好的模型在哪儿？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}And where is the trained model?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.30,0:16:16.65,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,脚本结束时，机器被删掉，权重也跟着没了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}When the script ends, the machine is deleted, and the weights with it:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.65,0:16:20.51,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,没有任何地方调用 model.save，model dir 参数也被忽略了\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}nothing calls model.save, and the --model-dir flag is ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.83,0:16:25.93,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第 15 讲会把模型存进 bucket；练习 4 今天就做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Lecture 15 saves the model to a bucket; exercise 4 does it today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.17,0:16:29.11,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,该收尾了；暂停一下，照着清单一项项做\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Time to shut down; pause and work through the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.43,0:16:35.19,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,在驾驶舱里或者控制台上，确认没有自定义任务还在运行或者排队\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}From inside the cockpit, or in the console, make sure no custom job is running or pending.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.51,0:16:38.33,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,也把 tar 包和实验目录删掉\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Remove the tarball and experiment folders too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.65,0:16:42.10,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,然后 exit；额外跑一下 docker ps，什么都没剩\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Then exit; an extra docker ps shows nothing left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.42,0:16:46.88,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,结束最后一个 W&B run，断开 Colab 的运行时\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Finish the last W&B run, and disconnect the Colab runtimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.20,0:16:50.52,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,学期结束时，删掉 model-trainer 的密钥\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}At the end of term, delete the model-trainer key
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:53.90,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,并轮换你的 W&B 密钥，因为它跟着任务出去过\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}and rotate your W&B key, which traveled in a job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:55.94,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,整节课都在一张地图上\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}The whole lecture on one map.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.26,0:16:58.95,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一个 run 有多大用处，取决于它存下了什么\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}A run is only as useful as what it keeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:02.83,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,曲线要靠 callback；config 要放进 wandb.init\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Curves need a callback; config goes into wandb.init.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.15,0:17:06.16,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,只有 tar 包会被带过去，装进 Google 的 image\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Only the tarball travels, into Google's image,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.16,0:17:09.55,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,以服务代理的身份运行，你的密钥就在它的参数里\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}run as the service agent, your key in its arguments.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.87,0:17:15.29,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,一块 GPU 要三个开关；两块 GPU 分开 batch，再平均梯度\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One GPU needs three switches; two GPUs split the batch and average gradients.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:19.12,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,五道自测题\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}5 questions to test yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.44,0:17:21.72,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第一题：两张表都没写下来的是什么？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}One: what did neither table write down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.04,0:17:25.63,Bilingual,,0,0,0,,第二题：什么会被带到 Vertex AI，什么从来不会？\N{\fs33\c&H00C8C0B8&\bord1.4}Two: what travels to Vertex AI, and what never does?
